<title>HONG KONG: Cheung Tai Hong year net returns to gain.</title>
<headline>Cheung Tai Hong year net returns to gain.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 5.0 gain     vs 12.9 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  1.0	    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	9.86 gain    vs 33.26 loss</p>
<p>    Net			  33.34 profit vs 75.74 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		   693.25	 vs 725.08</p>
<p>    Company name	     Cheung Tai Hong Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		August 1-7</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 August 15</p>
<p>NOTE - Cheung Tai Hong is an importor of diversified consumer goods.</p>
<p>Net is after an excepitonal gain on disposal of leasehold properties.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is one H.K. cent vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368.  Attp://www.hk97.com</p>
